{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.qAbs_eq_exp_neg_r","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.qAbs_eq_exp_neg_r","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.lean#L61-L63","doc":"Recovering the modulus from the scale: `|q| = e^{−r}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.r_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.r_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.lean#L55-L59","doc":"The scale `r = −ln|q|` is non-negative on the closed unit disc\n(`0 < |q| ≤ 1`), so `|q| = e^{−r}` with `r ≥ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.ω","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.ω","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The four spectral resolvents `ω₀,…,ω₃` (as elements of `H`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.k","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.k","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicSpectral