u/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuaternionicSpectralResolvents.lean#L22-L47","doc":"Data for the quaternionic spectral resolvents at a substrate value `q`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the modulus `|q|` with `0 < |q| ≤ 1`, the scale\n`r = −ln|q|`, the quaternion carrier `H` with its imaginary units\n`𝐢,𝐣,𝐤`, and the four resolvents. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:quaternionic-spectral-resolvents","label":"def:quaternionic-spectral-resolvents","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/quaternionic-spectral-resolvents.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}